<title>UK: MCIT to invest $36 mln in U.S. firm.</title>
<headline>MCIT to invest $36 mln in U.S. firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK specialist investment trust MCIT Plc said on Thursday that it has invested $36 million in U.S. company Winning Ways, Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;Winning Ways represents an exciting addition to our portfolio of investments,&quot; said Jock Green-Armytage, MCIT's chairman in a statement.</p>
<p>MCIT, formerly known as Mezzanine Capital &amp; Income Trust, was launched in 1986.</p>
<p>Winning Ways is a leading manufacturer of custom imprinted and embroidered activewear based in Kansas.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
